OL,3,GNEWSASalon owner's chore woes prompt
OL,4,Askill-swapping app
OL,5,
OL,6,FA salon owner says she was inspired to
OL,7,Fset up a skill-swapping app after she
OL,8,Fand her clients spent time "moaning"
OL,9,Fabout chores and admin.
OL,11,FMarie King, who owns Finishing Touches
OL,12,FBeauty, in Leckhampton, Cheltenham, set
OL,13,Fup Trade Off UK after some of her
OL,14,Fclients expressed concerns they could
OL,15,Fno longer afford to get their nails
OL,16,Fdone, and so they began exchanging
OL,17,Ftasks like cooking for beauty
OL,18,Ftreatments.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
