OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1795618570
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSASalon owner's chore woes prompt
OL,4,Askill-swapping app
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'd be more than happy to spend an
OL,7,Fextra hour in the salon doing
OL,8,Fsomebody's nails, rather than going
OL,9,Fhome and cooking a lasagne for my
OL,10,Fkids," she said.
OL,12,FRebecca O'Meegan, who exchanged skills
OL,13,Fwith King and other app users, said:
OL,14,F"It felt good to be useful and it was
OL,15,Flovely for it to be reciprocated".
